  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Barroom sphere, Brain Consumption.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Whenever you consume a creature’s brain using the Brain Consumption feat, you may gain the drunk status as if you had consumed an alcoholic drink. Alternatively, while you possess a bonus talent from Brain Consumption Consumptive Intuition, you may end the bonus talent’s duration to gain the drunk status as a free action. When you gain the drunk status in either of these ways, you gain the status for double the duration (twice Constitution modifier rounds + 1 per 2 points of base attack bonus).</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/practitioner-feats#toc13\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
